{"id": 15576, "title": "Favorite food", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "favorite-food", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/15576_favorite-food.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["我们一家三口人，每个人都有自己喜欢的食物。我喜欢吃蔬菜，特别喜欢辣的东西，但是不喜欢吃米饭。我的丈夫不但喜欢吃蔬菜，也喜欢吃肉。但是他不能吃辣，只喜欢吃清淡的食物。我们的孩子最喜欢甜的东西，面包、蛋糕、水果都是他最爱的。但是我们也很担心，因为他总是不喜欢吃肉和蔬菜，每次只能吃一点儿。怎么才能让孩子多吃健康的食物呢？"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["我們一家三口人，每個人都有自己喜歡的食物。我喜歡吃蔬菜，特別喜歡辣的東西，但是不喜歡吃米飯。我的丈夫不但喜歡吃蔬菜，也喜歡吃肉。但是他不能吃辣，只喜歡吃清淡的食物。我們的孩子最喜歡甜的東西，麵包、蛋糕、水果都是他最愛的。但是我們也很擔心，因為他總是不喜歡吃肉和蔬菜，每次只能吃一點兒。怎麼才能讓孩子多吃健康的食物呢？"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["wǒ men yī jiā sān kǒu rén， měi gè rén dōu yǒu zì jǐ xǐ huan de shí wù。 wǒ xǐ huan chī shū cài， tè bié xǐ huan là de dōng xi， dàn shì bù xǐ huan chī mǐ fàn。 wǒ de zhàng fu bù dàn xǐ huan chī shū cài， yě xǐ huan chī ròu。 dàn shì tā bù néng chī là， zhǐ xǐ huan chī qīng dàn de shí wù。 wǒ men de hái zi zuì xǐ huan tián de dōng xi， miàn bāo、 dàn gāo、 shuǐ guǒ dōu shì tā zuì ài de。 dàn shì wǒ men yě hěn dān xīn， yīn wèi tā zǒng shì bù xǐ huan chī ròu hé shū cài， měi cì zhǐ néng chī yī diǎn r。 zěn me cái néng ràng hái zi duō chī jiàn kāng de shí wù ne？"], "english_paragraphs": ["We are a family of three, and everyone has their own favorite food. I like to eat vegetables, especially spicy food, but I don't like rice. My husband not only likes to eat vegetables, but also likes to eat meat. But he can't eat spicy food and only likes to eat light food. Our child likes sweet things the most, including bread, cakes, and fruits. But we are also worried because he always doesn't like eating meat and vegetables and can only eat a little at a time. How can we get our children to eat more healthy food?"], "english_full": "We are a family of three, and everyone has their own favorite food. I like to eat vegetables, especially spicy food, but I don't like rice. My husband not only likes to eat vegetables, but also likes to eat meat. But he can't eat spicy food and only likes to eat light food. Our child likes sweet things the most, including bread, cakes, and fruits. But we are also worried because he always doesn't like eating meat and vegetables and can only eat a little at a time. How can we get our children to eat more healthy food?", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ men\" data-defn=\"we; us; ourselves; our\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiā\" data-defn=\"classifier for families or businesses\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"sān\" data-defn=\"three / 3\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">三</span><span class=\"tr\">三</span><rt>sān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kǒu\" data-defn=\"classifier for things with mouths / classifier for bites or mouthfuls\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">口</span><span class=\"tr\">口</span><rt>kǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"rén\" data-defn=\"person; people\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"měi\" data-defn=\"each / every\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">每</span><span class=\"tr\">每</span><rt>měi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"rén\" data-defn=\"person; people\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dōu\" data-defn=\"all; both; entirely\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt>