t so\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"néng\" data-defn=\"can / to be able to / might possibly\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">能</span><span class=\"tr\">能</span><rt>néng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chī\" data-defn=\"to eat; to consume / to eat at\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">吃</span><span class=\"tr\">吃</span><rt>chī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"là\" data-defn=\"hot (spicy) / pungent\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">辣</span><span class=\"tr\">辣</span><rt>là</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhǐ\" data-defn=\"only; merely; just\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">只</span><span class=\"tr\">只</span><rt>zhǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xǐ huan\" data-defn=\"to like; to be fond of\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huan</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chī\" data-defn=\"to eat; to consume / to eat at\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">吃</span><span class=\"tr\">吃</span><rt>chī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"qīng dàn\" data-defn=\"light (of food, not greasy or strongly flavored) / insipid / slack (sales)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">清淡</span><span class=\"tr\">清淡</span><rt>qīng dàn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shí wù\" data-defn=\"food\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">食物</span><span class=\"tr\">食物</span><rt>shí wù</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ men\" data-defn=\"we; us; ourselves; our\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hái zi\" data-defn=\"child\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">孩子</span><span class=\"tr\">孩子</span><rt>hái zi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zuì\" data-defn=\"(before an adjective or verb) to the highest degree; (the) most ...; -est\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">最</span><span class=\"tr\">最</span><rt>zuì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xǐ huan\" data-defn=\"to like; to be fond of\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huan</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tián\" data-defn=\"sweet\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">甜</span><span class=\"tr\">甜</span><rt>tián</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dōng xi\" data-defn=\"thing / stuff / person\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">东西</span><span class=\"tr\">東西</span><rt>dōng xi</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"miàn bāo\" data-defn=\"bread\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">面包</span><span class=\"tr\">麵包</span><rt>miàn bāo</rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dàn gāo\" data-defn=\"cake\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">蛋糕</span><span class=\"tr\">蛋糕</span><rt>dàn gāo</rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shuǐ guǒ\" data-defn=\"fruit\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">水果</span><span class=\"tr\">水果</span><rt>shuǐ guǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb